OL,3,CMichelle O'Neill accuses DUP of being
OL,4,C'anti-Irish'
OL,6,FThe First Minister has accused the DUP
OL,7,Fof being "anti-Irish".
OL,9,FMichelle O'Neill said her party is
OL,10,Ffrustrated by how Stormont is working
OL,11,Fand reform is needed.
OL,13,FThe deputy First Minister Emma Little-
OL,14,FPengelly hit back and said it is
OL,15,F"manufactured outrage" from Sinn Fein.
OL,17,FMeanwhile, during a visit to Belfast
OL,18,Fon Thursday, the Taoiseach Micheal
OL,19,FMartin said all the parties have an
OL,20,Fobligation to ensure Stormont remains
OL,21,Fin place.
OL,26,@wD@crrzD@arp
