PN,41805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786124905
OL,3,CMichelle O'Neill accuses DUP of being
OL,4,C'anti-Irish'
OL,6,F"I think the people demand that sort
OL,7,Fof political maturity to make sure
OL,8,Fthat withstanding all of the
OL,9,Fdifficulties that the institutions
OL,10,Fprevail."
OL,12,FThe Taoiseach said he supported calls
OL,13,Fby a number of the parties for reform
OL,14,Fat Stormont to bolster political
OL,15,Fstability.
OL,17,FHe added: "I certainly support reform,
OL,18,FI have been supporting reform of the
OL,19,Finstitutions for quite a number of
OL,20,Fyears.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@IO]yD@KOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/7
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,419,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F418A1786124905
OL,3,CMichelle O'Neill accuses DUP of being
OL,4,C'anti-Irish'
OL,6,F"Not everybody at the time agreed, but
OL,7,Fbit by bit more and more are coming
OL,8,Faround to supporting reform.
OL,10,F"I will speak to the new British Prime
OL,11,FMinister in September, and I note the
OL,12,Fcomments of the new Northern Ireland
OL,13,FSecretary of State.
OL,15,F"I believe that collectively we have
OL,16,Fto work together to bring forward
OL,17,Flegislation that is required."
